- * KEPT (CD-146b-7's mount point on all four pages' outer containers; test_page_layer.py
- * keys its `.page-layer`-suffixed selectors off it) as a pure layout contract:
- *   - padding-inline is always 0 (each page's own direct child eats one
- *     `--layer-inset`, not this class — CD-146b-7 ownership table);
