-/* ==========================================================================
- * B-T2: Glass overlay — lightbox / modal / popover / drawer (dim-only)
- *
- * All rules [data-theme="dim"]-scoped (IACVT iron rule).
- * Technique: padding-box/border-box dual background + transparent border.
- *   EVERY rule using this technique MUST have `border: 1px solid transparent`
- *   otherwise the border-box area does not exist and border gradient is invisible.
- * backdrop-filter ALWAYS double-written with -webkit-backdrop-filter (macOS
- *   PyWebView WKWebView requires -webkit- prefix).
