-/* Rule 42b — 81c-T6 / US-12: .notification-drawer mobile full-width sheet (≤480px)
- * WHAT: below 480px, convert the bell drawer from the Alpine-Anchor right-top 320px
- *   floating card into a navbar-bottom full-width fixed sheet, and switch from glass
- *   to a SOLID fill (backdrop-filter removed).
- * WHY (G2): the drawer is global (base.html) and opens on pages whose #main-content
- *   keeps view-transition-name (e.g. /search, /settings). A fixed element with
- *   backdrop-filter inside a VT backdrop-root samples per-frame → "逐格模糊" bug.
- *   Removing backdrop-filter (vs. the 0.10.4 :has() de-name trick) roots out the
- *   sampling source entirely — no #main-content vt-name change, no :has() rule.
- * SPECIFICITY / !important: x-anchor (Floating UI) writes left/top as INLINE style
- *   on every reposition (highest specificity), and Tailwind w-80 sets width. Only
- *   !important can override inline. The solid background + backdrop-filter:none must
- *   also beat the dim Rule 42 (0,2,0) above; this @media .notification-drawer is
- *   (0,1,0) so background/backdrop-filter need !important to win (Rule 42 has none).
- * THEME-AGNOSTIC: deliberately NOT [data-theme] scoped — the sheet is identical in
- *   light (overrides bg-base-100) and dim (overrides the glass), so a single
- *   !important background:var(--surface-2) covers both. NOTE: this is a guarded
- *   exception to the dim-scope backdrop-filter rule — backdrop-filter:none is the
- *   safe direction (it REMOVES filter, the very thing IACVT would do anyway), so it
- *   carries zero "silently drop glass in light" risk. */
-@media (max-width: 480px) {
-    .notification-drawer {
-        position: fixed !important;
-        left: 0 !important;
-        right: 0 !important;
-        top: var(--mobile-topbar-height) !important;     /* navbar height (.top-navbar / .main-content inset) */
-        width: 100% !important;     /* override Tailwind w-80 (20rem) */
-        border-radius: 0 !important;    /* full-bleed sheet edge-to-edge */
-        background: var(--surface-2) !important;    /* solid dropdown/modal token; beats dim glass */
-        backdrop-filter: none !important;
-        -webkit-backdrop-filter: none !important;
-    }
-}
